__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
results/*.log
results/*.err

# Regenerable caches. The FROZEN CORPUS is deliberately NOT ignored:
# data/cache/bpe_2048.json and data/cache/tokens_2048.npz define the exact
# token stream every result in results/ was measured against, and the
# methodology is "tokenize once, freeze, replay". Losing them would make new
# runs incomparable with old ones, and this tree has already been destroyed
# twice. The batch-offset tensors and the raw corpus text below are pure
# functions of those two files and of a seed, so they are not kept.
data/cache/*.pt
data/cache/tinystories_valid.txt
gpu/_payload/
gpu/_kernel/
